<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title><%= content_for(:title) ? "#{content_for(:title)} · Refunds & Payouts" : "Refunds & Payouts Ledger" %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="application-name" content="Refunds & Payouts Ledger">
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <%= yield :head %>

    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.png" type="image/png">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icon.png">

    <%= stylesheet_link_tag :app, "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
  </head>

  <body>
    <!--
      DIRECTION CONTRACT: impeccable, user-pinned (no roll)
      THESIS: A payments ledger read as a trading desk, not a dashboard of cards.
        Money is live data in ruled monospace columns; it refuses the metric-tile hero.
      OWN-WORLD: Near-black console (#0a0c10), hairline rules, one live green for
        credit, amber in-flight, red reversal. JetBrains Mono for every figure/id,
        Archivo for the few words. Elevation is the border, never a shadow.
      STORY: An operator sees, at a glance, that every halala is accounted for and
        that money moved exactly once, then issues a refund or payout with confidence.
      FIRST VIEWPORT: A terminal header with a live caret and status line, tab nav,
        then the register: a ruled table of refunds with mono amounts colored by sign.
      FORM: Trading terminal / data desk. User-pinned direction, beats the roll.
      FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md
    -->
    <header class="border-b border-line bg-bg-raise">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <%= link_to root_path, class: "group inline-flex items-baseline gap-0" do %>
            <span class="desk-title text-lg text-ink">refunds &amp; payouts</span><span class="caret"></span>
          <% end %>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">
            SAR · integer halalas · <span class="text-credit">double-entry</span> · money booked only on a signed webhook
          </p>
        </div>
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-6 overflow-x-auto pb-0 text-sm">
          <%= link_to "refunds",        refunds_path,        class: "nav-link py-3.5", "aria-current": ("page" if current_page?(refunds_path) || current_page?(root_path)) %>
          <%= link_to "payouts",        payouts_path,        class: "nav-link py-3.5", "aria-current": ("page" if current_page?(payouts_path)) %>
          <%= link_to "charges",        charges_path,        class: "nav-link py-3.5", "aria-current": ("page" if current_page?(charges_path)) %>
          <%= link_to "ledger",         ledger_path,         class: "nav-link py-3.5", "aria-current": ("page" if current_page?(ledger_path)) %>
          <%= link_to "reconciliation", reconciliation_path, class: "nav-link py-3.5", "aria-current": ("page" if current_page?(reconciliation_path)) %>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10">
      <% if notice %>
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-[#1c4c3b] bg-credit-dim px-4 py-3 text-sm text-credit">
          <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-xs">OK</span><span><%= notice %></span>
        </div>
      <% end %>
      <% if alert %>
        <div class="mb-8 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-[#522725] bg-debit-dim px-4 py-3 text-sm text-debit">
          <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-xs">!!</span><span><%= alert %></span>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <%= yield %>
    </main>

    <footer class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line pt-5 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <span>balances derived from an append-only log · reversed exactly once</span>
        <span class="flex gap-5">
          <%= link_to "audit", audit_path, class: "hover:text-credit" %>
          <%= link_to "health", health_path, class: "hover:text-credit" %>
          <a href="/openapi.yaml" class="hover:text-credit">api</a>
        </span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
